# YubiKey signing (docs/piv-yubikey.md): Yubico's public attestation
# certificates and test fixtures are embedded at build time, and the bridge
# is its own module -- these must be committed despite the rules above.
!internal/piv/**/*.pem
!clients/piv-bridge/go.mod
!clients/piv-bridge/go.sum

